{"displayStem":"같은 장비의 두 영역에서 확산 강조 신호를 비교한다. 가의 b=0 신호는 매우 높고, 두 영역 모두 고 b값 영상에서 주변보다 밝다. 아래는 S(b)/S(0)의 감쇠 모형이다. 관류·움직임 교란은 없으며 단일지수 모형을 사용했다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 독립 작성 모의자료"}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C10 c10-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"c10-visual\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"b값 (s/mm²)와 b=0 대비 신호 (무차원)\"><text x=\"270\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\">정규화한 신호</text><text x=\"15\" y=\"49\">b=0 대비 신호 (무차원)</text><path d=\"M70 60V260H490\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\"></path><path d=\"M70 260v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"70\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M280 260v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"280\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">500</text><path d=\"M490 260v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"490\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1000</text><path d=\"M65 260h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><path d=\"M65 160h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"165\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.5</text><path d=\"M65 60h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><polyline points=\"70,60 112,97.88 154,128.6 196,153.48000000000002 238,173.66000000000003 280,190.01999999999998 322,203.26 364,214.02 406,222.72 448,229.78 490,235.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></polyline><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"60\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"112\" cy=\"97.88\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"154\" cy=\"128.6\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"196\" cy=\"153.48000000000002\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"238\" cy=\"173.66000000000003\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"190.01999999999998\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"322\" cy=\"203.26\" r=\"2.5\